# --- Benchmark artifacts and experimental results ---
# The repository's source is public, but genuine results stay private and
# external: they are written outside the repository entirely (LAB_RESULTS_DIR)
# and enter Git only via an explicitly approved sanitized release.
# Only the placeholder README is tracked — .gitignore is not the boundary.
results/*
!results/README.md
runs/
artifacts/
outputs/
raw/
*.csv
*.parquet
*.jsonl
!**/fixtures/**/*.jsonl
!**/testdata/**/*.jsonl

